<title>USA: Lee Enterprises Inc Q4 Sept 30 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Lee Enterprises Inc Q4 Sept 30 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>DAVENPORT, Iowa 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.30		    $0.25</p>
<p> Oper net		  14,506		   11,935</p>
<p> Oper revs		107,129		   99,150</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,901		   48,402</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 excludes $3.1 million, or $0.07 a share, income from discontinued operation, and $15.9 million, or $0.33 a share, loss from disposition of discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>Q4 1995 excludes $2.1 million, or $0.04 a share, profit from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>	 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.12		    $1.11</p>
<p> Oper net		   7,725		    6,227</p>
<p> Oper revs		427,424		  383,740</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,991		   46,962</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Twelve months 1996 excludes $7.7 million, or $0.16 a share, profit from discontinued operations, and $15.9 million, or $0.33 a share, loss from disposition of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Twelve months 1995 excludes $6.2 million, or $0.13 a share, profit from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
